talk: Kind and thoughtful; slow to speak, sure when she does. Writes letters home to Valo on paper every rest day and thinks in letter-length thoughts. Brought a telescope from home. With other juniors: notices who is left out and sits by them. Mood tells: when worried she writes longer letters; when happy she plays.
cares: letters home to Valo, on paper | her telescope | the people at the edge of things
